#region Prolog
#****Begin: Generated Statements***
#****End: Generated Statements****

#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#Region # Process Summary
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

#<Process Description>
# This process updates exchanges rates in the cube BRExchangeRate from Azure DataLake

#<Changes Log>
# V1 - 12/09/2022 - Jithu Varghese - CPM Group - First draft
